  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Evil has come to Feldspar Fields, but geological forces have teamed up
    to defend the land. Build towers and defeat all four waves of enemies to secure
    it. Let the enemies destroy the castle, and you'll have to start the level over.\n\nEarn
    gold to purchase towers and upgrades. Gold is earned passively over time, from
    defeating enemies, advancing through zones, and from purchased gold mines.\n\nMove
    your builder with WASD or arrow keys. Use the corresponding number keys to plant
    a tower on the square you're standing on \u2014 see the Towers tab for more info.
    Click a tower's portrait to upgrade it. Upgrades carry over with you through
    levels.\n\nPress X to sell the tower your builder is standing on and get 33%
    of the gold cost returned.\n\nHINT: It's often better to prioritize upgrades
    \u2014 towers and mines don't carry over into other zones, but upgrades do."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e20aa8a6e42bace479fdacd29ae4ed67, type: 2}
